# AirFryerSmart — redirect rules (Cloudflare Pages + Netlify)
#
# READ THIS ONLY WHEN YOU BUY YOUR CUSTOM DOMAIN:
# After you add the custom domain in Cloudflare Pages and update SITE_URL in
# config.js (then re-run `node tools/build.js`), uncomment the two lines below
# to 301-redirect every old free-subdomain URL to the custom domain. This keeps
# all your Google rankings and backlinks when you switch.
#
# Example for airfryersmart.com:
# https://airfryersmart.pages.dev/*  https://airfryersmart.com/:splat  301
# https://airfryersmart.pages.dev    https://airfryersmart.com/        301
#
# Do NOT enable these while you are still on the free subdomain — it would
# redirect the site to a domain you do not own yet.
